            "type" : "text",
            "text" : "<html>\n  <head>\n    \n  </head>\n  <body>\n    Simple step. Every step has an ID which is automatically modified when the \n    step changes its position within the step sequence. The IDs always make up \n    a gapless number sequence. Specman immediately renumbers steps when they \n    are moved or steps are inserted before.\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
